{"id":51,"slug":"rattletrap","name":"发条技师","en":"Clockwerk","aliases":["发条","clock"],"attr":"str","attrLabel":"力量","attack":"近战","roles":["先手","控制","爆发","耐久"],"positions":[4,3],"positionLabels":["4 号位","3 号位"],"positionNames":["软辅 / 游走","劣势路核心"],"lanes":["游走","劣势路"],"complexity":2,"complexityLabel":"中等","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/rattletrap.png","art":"assets/heroes/art/rattletrap.jpg","card":"assets/heroes/cards/rattletrap.png","winrate":47.67,"pickrate":2.63,"trend":[47.38,47.86,47.93,47.85,47.45,47.74,47.19],"delta":-0.19,"pubPick":100990,"pubWin":48139,"proPick":10,"proWin":3,"proBan":5,"lore":"瑞托崔普和狙击手以及修补匠同属于一个分布广泛的种族，和基恩一族的许多人一样，瑞托崔普利用他的智慧和一些小玩意弥补了体型上的矮小。作为一个钟表匠的孙子，瑞托崔普在这个行业当了很多年的学徒，直到战争从山的另一边席卷而来，摧毁了平原上的村庄，这个纯洁的行业也受到了波及。世代相传的村庄变成了满是焦火和黑烟的废墟，“你的新行业是战斗，”他的父亲临死前留下这样一句话。\r\n\t\t\t\t\n\n可悲的手艺人才会责怪自己的工具，而瑞托崔普从来不找借口。在村庄的废墟中埋葬了父亲后，瑞托崔普开始着手将他自己转变为最强大的战争道具，在任何世界上都将是前所未见的。他发誓永远不再毫无防备地被抓住，运用他的天赋装配了一套强大的发条动力装甲，其他土地上的骑士相比之下就像是锡罐。现在瑞托崔普全身布满各种装置，身形不大却极为致命，他埋伏和破坏的技术已经达到了几乎全自动化的高效水平。这个死亡工匠的机械装置可以迅速干掉不够谨慎的敌人，在这个战争时代宣告了新的曙光。现在是几点了？是发条技师的钟点！","hype":"发条技师射出钩爪使自己飞入敌人人群中，将目标隔离后用弹片冲击搅得他们晕头转向。他用实用的照明弹侦察战场，不费吹灰之力就能找到合适的目标。","npe":"钩爪能把自己射向敌人","stats":{"health":692,"healthRegen":3.1,"mana":291,"manaRegen":0.9,"damage":"50–52","armor":3.2,"magicResistance":25,"moveSpeed":310,"attackRange":150,"attackRate":1.7,"turnRate":0.6,"sightDay":1800,"sightNight":800,"str":{"base":26,"gain":3.2},"agi":{"base":13,"gain":2.3},"int":{"base":18,"gain":1.7}},"abilities":[{"id":5237,"key":"rattletrap_battery_assault","name":"弹幕冲击","en":"Battery Assault","desc":"向附近敌方单位随机射出高能弹片，造成小额魔法伤害和短暂眩晕。","lore":"瑞托崔普挂载的部分装置运作不良，因此将其引爆也是种有效的进攻手段。","notes":["发条技师被控制后仍然有效。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"radius","label":"作用范围","value":"275"},{"key":"duration","label":"持续时间","value":"10.5 秒"},{"key":"interval","label":"间隔","value":"0.7"},{"key":"damage","label":"伤害","value":"20 / 45 / 70 / 95"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"24 / 22 / 20 / 18 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"75 / 80 / 85 / 90"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/rattletrap_battery_assault.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5238,"key":"rattletrap_power_cogs","name":"能量齿轮","en":"Power Cogs","desc":"在发条技师周围形成一圈通电的齿轮，困住附近的单位。在外侧的敌人碰到齿轮会被电流震退，损失一定的生命和魔法。并且50%损失魔法也会加入到伤害。一个齿轮发动过一次震击后就会报废。\n\n敌人攻击齿轮数次后可将其摧毁，而发条技师需要攻击一次会将齿轮推出850 / 900 / 950 / 1000距离。发条技师可以自由穿行齿轮，穿行时会使齿轮失效。","lore":"发条技师最骄傲的发明之一就是他的能量齿轮——虽然有时会被他的盟友轻视。","notes":["齿轮可以震退隐身单位。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"duration","label":"持续时间","value":"5 / 6 / 7 / 8 秒"},{"key":"damage","label":"伤害","value":"55 / 110 / 165 / 220"},{"key":"mana_burn","label":"魔法值损失","value":"40 / 75 / 110 / 145"},{"key":"attacks_to_destroy","label":"摧毁齿轮的攻击次数","value":"2"},{"key":"cogs_radius","label":"成型范围","value":"215"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"21 / 19 / 17 / 15 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"90"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/rattletrap_power_cogs.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5239,"key":"rattletrap_rocket_flare","name":"照明火箭","en":"Rocket Flare","desc":"向全地图范围内的指定区域发射照明弹。击中时对区域内敌人造成伤害和短暂减速。照明火箭提供6秒击中区域的视野。","lore":"最初用作节日的焰火，现在成了侦察和轰炸敌人的工具。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"radius","label":"作用范围","value":"600"},{"key":"damage","label":"伤害","value":"80 / 120 / 160 / 200"},{"key":"slow_pct","label":"移动速度减缓","value":"100%"},{"key":"slow_duration","label":"减速持续时间","value":"0.4 秒"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"20 / 18 / 16 / 14 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"35 / 40 / 45 / 50"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/rattletrap_rocket_flare.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":321,"key":"rattletrap_overclocking","name":"超速运转","en":"Overclocking","desc":"使发条技师的所有技能变得强力：\n\n弹幕冲击：作用范围提升，并且可以作用于范围内所有敌人。\n能量齿轮：成型范围提升，并且发条技师靠近能量齿轮时护甲提升。\n照明火箭：伤害、视野和减速时间提升，并且发射时向目标两侧各额外发射一枚。\n发射钩爪：眩晕范围和时间均有提升。\n喷气背包：移动得更快。\n\n持续时间结束后发条技师的移动和攻击速度降到最低。","lore":"瑞托崔普明白他装甲的局限性。就像他明白在必要的情况下越界的风险。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"buff_duration","label":"持续时间","value":"18 秒"},{"key":"debuff_duration","label":"自身减速时间","value":"3 秒"},{"key":"bonus_armor_pct","label":"靠近齿轮的额外护甲","value":"25%"},{"key":"battery_assault_radius","label":"弹幕冲击作用范围","value":"330"},{"key":"cogs_radius","label":"齿轮成型半径","value":"330"},{"key":"hookshot_radius_bonus_pct","label":"发射钩爪额外作用范围","value":"50%"},{"key":"hookshot_duration_bonus_pct","label":"发射钩爪额外眩晕时间","value":"50%"},{"key":"rocket_flare_rockets","label":"额外照明火箭","value":"2"},{"key":"rocket_flare_duration_pct","label":"照明火箭额外持续时间","value":"35%"},{"key":"rocket_flare_damage_pct","label":"照明火箭额外伤害","value":"35%"},{"key":"jetpack_bonus_speed","label":"喷气背包速度","value":"40%"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"50 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"90"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/rattletrap_overclocking.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":true},{"id":630,"key":"rattletrap_jetpack","name":"喷气背包","en":"Jetpack","desc":"发条技师开动喷气背包，获得飞行移动状态，飞行视野和移动速度加成。发条技师的转身速率大幅降低，并且无法攻击。在加成状态的持续时间内可以开启和关闭喷气背包。","lore":"的确是炸掉了十四个测试的假人，但至少他们都飞起来了！","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"bonus_speed","label":"移动速度加成","value":"20%"},{"key":"duration","label":"持续时间","value":"6 秒"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"16 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"75"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/rattletrap_jetpack.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1295,"key":"rattletrap_armor_power","name":"装甲力量","en":"Armor Power","desc":"发条技师的每点护甲都会使伤害输出增加0.25%。\n\n发条技师可以消耗锁子甲，永久获得+4点护甲。可以叠加。对自身施放后即可消耗。","lore":"","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"damage_tooltip","label":"伤害输出加成","value":"0%"}],"chips":[],"type":"innate","typeLabel":"先天技能","icon":"assets/abilities/rattletrap_armor_power.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5240,"key":"rattletrap_hookshot","name":"发射钩爪","en":"Hookshot","desc":"向目标位置高速射出钩爪，如果命中一个单位，发条技师会将自己牵引到目标身边，对目标附近175范围内所有敌人造成眩晕和伤害。对牵引时冲撞到的单位也造成伤害和眩晕。","lore":"钩爪虽然是有点笨重的设备，但能让更加厚重的发条装甲在半空中来去如风。","notes":["发射钩爪可以抓住友方单位并将发条技师牵引过去，但是不会造成伤害和眩晕。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"duration","label":"眩晕时间","value":"1.2 / 1.4 / 1.6 秒"},{"key":"damage","label":"伤害","value":"75 / 175 / 275"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"60 / 45 / 30 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"100 / 125 / 150"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"2000 / 2500 / 3000"}],"type":"ultimate","typeLabel":"终极技能","icon":"assets/abilities/rattletrap_hookshot.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false}],"talents":[{"level":10,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_mp_regen_150","name":"+1.5 魔法恢复","en":"+1.5 Mana Regen"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_clockwerk_hookshot_damage","name":"+75 发射钩爪伤害","en":"+75 Hookshot Damage"}]},{"level":15,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_clockwerk_5","name":"--8秒 发射钩爪冷却","en":"-8s Hookshot Cooldown"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_clockwerk_3","name":"+25 弹幕冲击伤害","en":"+25 Battery Assault Damage"}]},{"level":20,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_clockwerk_4","name":"照明火箭具有真实视域","en":"Rocket Flare True Sight"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_clockwerk_2","name":"+80 能量齿轮魔法损失","en":"+80 Power Cogs Mana Burn"}]},{"level":25,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_clockwerk_rocket_flare_charges","name":"3 照明火箭能量点数","en":"3 Rocket Flare Charges"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_clockwerk","name":"--0.25秒 弹幕冲击间隔","en":"-0.25s Battery Assault Interval"}]}],"build":{"start_game_items":[{"slug":"ward_dispenser","name":"侦察·岗哨守卫","img":"assets/items/ward_dispenser.png","cost":50,"count":96,"heat":100},{"slug":"tango","name":"树之祭祀","img":"assets/items/tango.png","cost":90,"count":89,"heat":92.71},{"slug":"branches","name":"铁树枝干","img":"assets/items/branches.png","cost":55,"count":78,"heat":81.25},{"slug":"blood_grenade","name":"血腥榴弹","img":"assets/items/blood_grenade.png","cost":50,"count":74,"heat":77.08},{"slug":"boots","name":"速度之靴","img":"assets/items/boots.png","cost":500,"count":46,"heat":47.92},{"slug":"smoke